【来源1】{"claim": "Andrew advises that the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important when considering getting a dog.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: Meeting all these adorable pups has been awesome! For those considering getting a pup, the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important. For me, a person living in an apartment, a smaller dog would be best, but if one is active, consider getting one that loves to play and run.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Andrew has been looking for a dog to adopt since the last conversation, browsing websites, visiting shelters, and asking friends.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: [Image: a photography of a dog looking through a cage at the camera] Hey! Since we last spoke, I've been looking for a doggo to adopt - browsing websites, visiting shelters and asking friends of theirs. It's been both fun and annoying!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Andrew wants to live near a park or woods to stay close to nature and give the dog a large open space to run around.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: I'm looking for a place near a park or woods, so I can stay close to nature and give the dog a large open space to run around", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Andrew will keep looking until he finds the dog-friendly spot.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-02T14:42:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: Thanks! I'll keep looking until I find it. Super excited for what's next!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Andrew is considering getting a dog.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-02T14:42:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: That's great to hear! I'm considering getting a dog too, but it can be challenging finding a dog-friendly place in the city. Do you have any tips on finding such a place?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Andrew finds it challenging to find a dog-friendly place in the city.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-02T14:42:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: That's great to hear! I'm considering getting a dog too, but it can be challenging finding a dog-friendly place in the city. Do you have any tips on finding such a place?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Andrew lives in an apartment.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-06T10:47:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: Meeting all these adorable pups has been awesome! For those considering getting a pup, the size of living space and the exercise needs of the breed are important. For me, a person living in an apartment, a smaller dog would be best, but if one is active, consider getting one that loves to play and run.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Audrey's dogs love chasing the ball or frisbee.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Audrey", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T17:41:00+00:00", "text": "Audrey: [Image: a photography of a dog catching a frisbee in a field] When I take them out, we usually play fetch with a ball or frisbee. They love chasing it! We also meet other dog owners in the park and have a doggie playdate. It's a great way for me to chat with people and for them to make new friends.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Andrew misses exploring nature trails with his family's dog.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Andrew", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-02T14:42:00+00:00", "text": "Andrew: [Image: a photo of a man walking a dog on a trail] That pic is so cute! It would be fun to hang out with a dog, cuddling away. Got me thinking of my old hiking pics and how much I miss exploring nature trails with my family's dog. Ah, the peaceful moments out in nature!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
